G","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[226]}],"title":"Positive Prompt","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["change the skirt color to green\n\nmasterpiece, best quality\nAdd the caption \"AP\" to the bottom right corner."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":12,"type":"Note","pos":[2156.4380961771294,410.6093660305033],"size":[327.38888888888914,934.8333333333333],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Resources","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Important: This workflow relies on the ComfyUI-Cosmos-Reference node for image conditioning. A standard Image-to-Image pipeline without this node will not produce the intended editing behavior.\n\nModels used in this workflow\n\nBase Model\n\n• Anima Base v1.0\n\nText Encoder\n\n• qwen_3_06b_base\n\nVAE\n\n• qwen_image_vae\n\nLoRA\n\n• anima_edit_yaae_v01\n\nRequired Custom Node\n\nThis workflow requires the ComfyUI-Cosmos-Reference custom node.\n\nDownloads\nBase Model\n\nhttps://civitai.red/api/download/models/3020412?fileId=2899273\n\nVAE\n\nhttps://civitai.red/api/download/models/2945208?fileId=2824385\n\nText Encoder\n\nhttps://civitai.red/api/download/models/2945208?fileId=2824387\n\nLoRA\n\nhttps://civitai.red/models/2820047/yaae-or-yet-another-anima-edit\n\nCosmos Reference\n\nhttps://github.com/Mirumo0u0/ComfyUI-Cosmos-Reference\n\nInstall using:\n\ngit clone https://github.com/Mirumo0u0/ComfyUI-Cosmos-Reference\n\ninside your ComfyUI/custom_nodes directory.\n\n\nNote: All models used in this workflow were downloaded from Civitai.red.\n\nCredits\n\nSpecial thanks to the original developers for creating these excellent models and tools.\n"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":13,"type":"Note","pos":[1544.3825406215801,412.6093660305034],"size":[609.0555555555557,928.6666666666665],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Workflow Notes","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Workflow Goal\n\nProvide a clean reference implementation for Anima-based image editing.\n\nUse this workflow as a starting point and adapt the edit instructions to match your preferred artistic direction.\n\nWorkflow Type\n\nImage-to-Image (Instruction-based Editing)\n\nThis workflow demonstrates instruction-based image editing using the YAAE (Yet Another Anima Edit) LoRA.\n\nYAAE v0.1 is described by its author as a proof-of-concept for the current training pipeline. As with many early image editing models, results may vary depending on the input image, edit instruction, and random seed.\n\nObserved Behavior\n\n✓ Character identity, facial features, and overall pose are generally preserved very well.\n\n✓ Localized edits (such as clothing color, object replacement, and background modification) produce good results in most cases.\n\n✓ Short, natural-language edit instructions generally provide the most consistent results.\n\nAs this is a proof-of-concept image editing model, results may vary depending on the input image, edit instruction, and random seed.\n\nCertain edits may also influence nearby semantically related regions. For example, changing a clothing color may occasionally affect nearby accessories or hair color. Likewise, large scene edits (such as replacing the entire background) may preserve the original composition while producing minor perspective or object placement inconsistencies.\n\nIf the desired edit is not achieved on the first attempt, consider:\n\nrefining the edit instruction,\ntrying a different random seed,\nregenerating the image.\n\nOverall, the workflow provides a strong foundation for exploring instruction-based image editing with Anima and serves as an excellent starting point for further experimentation.\n\nVersion\n\nVersion 1.0\n\nCreated as a minimal reference workflow for getting started with image editing using the Anima model family.\n\nPurpose\n\n✓ Educational\n\n✓ Minimal\n\n✓ Easy to extend\n\nVerified\n\n✓ Image-to-Image Editing\n\nVerified Settings\n\n✓ Steps: 25\n\n✓ CFG: 4.0\n\n✓ Sampler: sa_solver_pece\n\n✓ Scheduler: Simple\n\nThese settings were used to validate this workflow and are recommended as the baseline configuration.\n\nVerified Resolution\n\n✓ 832 × 1216 (SDXL HD Portrait)\n\n✓ 592 × 1024\n\n\nHardware Tested\n\n✓ NVIDIA RTX 2080 (8 GB VRAM)\n\n✓ 64 GB System RAM\n\n✓ ComfyUI 0.27.0\n\nNext\n\n□ Image-to-Video Editing\n\n□ Image Upscaling"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":16,"type":"Note","pos":[2710.984635914924,1783.247735320215],"size":[606.666666666667,543.9999999999998],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["(masterpiece, best quality, absurdres, ultra detailed, official anime illustration, premium collectible crystal artifact, FisherKing Crystal Collection)\n\n=== ART STYLE ===\n\nluxurious fantasy trading card, premium collectible artifact, ornate crystal frame, magical gemstone craftsmanship, dimensional crystal sculpture, vibrant cinematic colors, intricate gold filigree, crystalline reflections, translucent gemstone architecture, volumetric lighting, glowing caustics, premium fantasy concept art, dramatic perspective, centered composition, elegant typography area, collectible masterpiece, luxurious fantasy illustration\n\n\n=== CHARACTER ===\n\nlegendary swordsman inspired by Roronoa Zoro, muscular athletic build, short spiky emerald green hair, three sword style, one katana clenched in his mouth, fearless expression, scar over left eye, black kimono partially open, dynamic forward slashing pose, haki aura, powerful perspective\n\nancient emerald crystal artifact responding to overwhelming sword intent, razor sharp emerald crystal shards, angular crystalline fractures, dimensional crystal blades, emerald energy flowing through translucent gemstone, crystal splitting perfectly along sword trajectories, green mana illuminating every crystal edge\n\n\nornate emerald crystal frame, engraved sword motifs, legendary blade engravings, crystal katana guards, ancient Wano ornaments, emerald gemstones embedded into gold filigree, premium magical craftsmanship\n\n\nstormy battlefield, distant Wano landscape, floating emerald crystal debris, swirling haki winds, cinematic atmosphere\n\n\ncinematic volumetric lighting, magical bloom, ray traced reflections, high dynamic range, rich color harmony, glowing crystal refractions, premium illustration lighting\n\n\n\nfull collectible trading card, centered hero composition, ornate crystal border, title space at top, subtitle space below, quote plaque at bottom, no cropped character, premium card layout\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[2,1,0,2,0,"IMAGE"],[11,14,0,5,0,"MODEL"],[12,15,0,5,1,"CLIP"],[219,17,0,22,0,"IMAGE"],[226,10,0,23,1,"CONDITIONING"],[227,8,0,23,2,"CONDITIONING"],[228,22,0,23,3,"LATENT"],[230,23,0,1,0,"LATENT"],[231,20,0,23,0,"MODEL"],[257,22,0,20,1,"LATENT"],[298,3,0,22,1,"VAE"],[299,3,0,1,1,"VAE"],[300,5,0,20,0,"MODEL"],[301,5,1,10,0,"CLIP"],[302,5,1,8,0,"CLIP"],[303,1,0,24,1,"IMAGE"],[304,17,0,24,0,"IMAGE"],[305,24,0,26,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Load Model","bounding":[2507.111782658958,341.4386060920247,398.85410292319193,436.66094703765924],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"Prompt Guidance","bounding":[2918.864008289085,691.6287022907569,591.2018363492898,655.2183493568247],"color":"#b58b2a","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"Sampling","bounding":[3523.3700454740842,342.7204771416142,336.56473100613675,999.986755390568],"color":"#A88","flags":{}},{"id":4,"title":"Decoded Output","bounding":[3866.34347165199,344.56518761467584,348.2089650282528,997.03239